# The diagnostic entry's own configuration, on its parent's: its handlers'
# state is at namespace scope, so that a handler allocates nothing (B25's
# allowance); and Windows' SIGABRT handler runs on the thread that called
# abort, not asynchronously, while Linux's handlers, signal.cpp's, call
# only the async-signal-safe functions its case reads from the object; and
# dbghelp declares MINIDUMP_TYPE, a set of flags, as an enum without their
# combinations, which the minidump's type is.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >-
  -cppcoreguidelines-avoid-non-const-global-variables,
  -bugprone-signal-handler,
  -clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange
